# Unloop Cursor guardrails

Concise always-on constraints for agent work. Project workflow, backlog, and architecture expectations live in `AGENTS.md`—do not duplicate them here.

- Durable artifacts (code, comments, docs, commits, UI strings) must be English.
- Use only `unloopyourself.dev@gmail.com` as the project contact. Never put personal names or personal emails in repo artifacts.
- Do not use Cursor Cloud Agents or other paid/metered cloud agent paths. Prefer local execution.
- Do not add analytics, crash-reporting, or behavioral telemetry SDKs. Do not send usage/behavior data off-device.
- Do not commit secrets or create paid/external accounts/deployments unless the human explicitly approved.
- Do not scaffold Expo / `apps/mobile` unless the active `factory/BACKLOG.md` item requires it.
- Prefer deterministic scripts and tests over extra agent/persona passes for the same check.
